 "paragraphs": [
  "Aliya and Zade thought for a few minutes. “We need to count how many gray mangrove trees we see,” Aliya said.",
  "Zade looked quickly around. “That’s easy. There are six trees.”",
  "“Correct,” said the fox. “Now you must find the flamingos for the next puzzle. Walk along the beach until you see them frolicking in the water. Do not forget the number of trees.”",
  "“Let’s take 6 shells to remember how many trees we counted,” Zade suggested."
 ],
